<title>POLAND: BROK JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>BROK JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.43 vs   0.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.78 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.84 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Sales		    8.61 vs   6.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.70 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.13 vs   1.35</p>
